  "implementationDetails": {
    "audioStrategy": "One AudioContext. Each note is routed by LayeredEngine to the enabled piano layers (A/B); each layer owns its voices (own NoteEngine). A voice is AudioBufferSourceNode(s) playing the nearest recorded zone for the touch-mapped velocity layer (or a generated buffer for Clav/Digital/Misc), unison copies through StereoPanners, a velocity low-pass and an envelope gain into the layer bus. Layer bus -> Timbre EQ (+ String Res comb bank) -> Mod 1 -> Mod 2 -> Delay -> Amp Sim/EQ -> Compressor -> Reverb -> layer level -> (direct | To Rotary -> shared Rotary) -> master gain (Master Level) -> limiter (DynamicsCompressor) -> destination.",
